---
import BaseLayout from "../../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import SiteHeader from "../../../../../components/SiteHeader.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Hermes Connect Load Board Access"
  description="Create or sign in to your Hermes account, register your company, then complete role-appropriate access review for the Hermes Load Board. Catalog publication remains clearly labeled until business facts are verified."
  robots="noindex,nofollow"
>
  <SiteHeader theme="light" activePath="/paths/logistics/" />
  <main id="main-content" class="lb-access">
    <section class="lb-access-hero">
      <div class="lb-access-shell">
        <a class="lb-back" href="/load-board/" data-i18n="back">← Back to Load Board preview</a>
        <p class="lb-kicker" data-i18n="kicker">Hermes Connect · Load Board access</p>
        <h1 data-i18n="title">One Hermes account. One company. Access matched to your role.</h1>
        <p class="lb-lead" data-i18n="lead">The public Load Board is the curtain view. Create or sign in to your Hermes account, add the company you operate with, and follow the correct workspace. Carrier-only freight access requires separate Hermes approval.</p>
        <div class="lb-flow" aria-label="Load Board access steps" data-i18n-aria="flowLabel">
          <div><strong>1</strong><span data-i18n="f1">Hermes account</span><small data-i18n="f1s">Create one or sign in</small></div>
          <div><strong>2</strong><span data-i18n="f2">Company</span><small data-i18n="f2s">Add operating company facts</small></div>
          <div><strong>3</strong><span data-i18n="f3">Hermes Catalog</span><small data-i18n="f3s">Optional self-submitted listing</small></div>
          <div><strong>4</strong><span data-i18n="f4">Load Board</span><small data-i18n="f4s">Approved carrier access</small></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="lb-access-body">
      <div class="lb-access-shell lb-access-grid">
        <div class="lb-access-card" data-auth-card>
          <div class="lb-card-head">
            <p class="lb-kicker" data-i18n="step1">Step 1</p>
            <h2 data-i18n="acct">Your Hermes account</h2>
            <p data-auth-state data-i18n="checking">Checking whether you are already signed in…</p>
          </div>

          <div class="lb-social-auth" data-social-auth hidden>
            <div class="lb-google-button" data-google-auth-button aria-label="Continue with Google" data-i18n-aria="googleAria"></div>
            <div class="lb-or" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><small data-i18n="orEmail">or continue with email</small><span></span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="lb-tabs" data-auth-tabs>
            <button type="button" class="is-active" data-auth-tab="register" data-i18n="tabRegister">Create account</button>
            <button type="button" data-auth-tab="login" data-i18n="tabLogin">Sign in</button>
          </div>

          <form class="lb-form" data-register-form>
            <label><span class="lb-t" data-i18n="name">Full name</span><input name="name" autocomplete="name" required minlength="2" /></label>
            <label><span class="lb-t" data-i18n="email">Email</span><input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required /></label>
            <label><span class="lb-t" data-i18n="password">Password</span><input name="password" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" required minlength="8" /></label>
            <label><span class="lb-t" data-i18n="role">Your role</span>
              <select name="role" required>
                <option value="Carrier" data-i18n="rCarrier">Carrier</option>
                <option value="Owner-Operator" data-i18n="rOwnerOp">Owner-Operator</option>
                <option value="Dispatcher" data-i18n="rDispatcher">Dispatcher</option>
                <option value="Fleet Owner" data-i18n="rFleet">Fleet Owner</option>
                <option value="Dealer Operations" data-i18n="rDealer">Dealer</option>
                <option value="Shipper Operations" data-i18n="rShipper">Shipper</option>
                <option value="Broker Operations" data-i18n="rBroker">Broker</option>
              </select>
            </label>
            <label><span class="lb-t" data-i18n="location">City / location</span><input name="location" required minlength="2" placeholder="Chicago, IL" /></label>
            <button class="lb-primary" type="submit" data-i18n="createBtn">Create Hermes account</button>
          </form>

          <form class="lb-form" data-login-form hidden>
            <label><span class="lb-t" data-i18n="email">Email</span><input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required /></label>
            <label><span class="lb-t" data-i18n="password">Password</span><input name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required /></label>
            <button class="lb-primary" type="submit" data-i18n="loginBtn">Sign in to Hermes</button>
          </form>
          <p class="lb-message" data-auth-message role="status"></p>
        </div>

        <div class="lb-access-card" data-company-card hidden>
          <div class="lb-card-head">
            <p class="lb-kicker" data-i18n="step2">Step 2</p>
            <h2 data-i18n="companyH">Register the company you operate with</h2>
            <p data-i18n="companyP">Company registration does not by itself unlock restricted carrier freight. If you opt in to Hermes Catalog, only the safe public facts below are listed before verification.</p>
          </div>
          <form class="lb-form" data-company-form>
            <label><span class="lb-t" data-i18n="companyName">Company name</span><input name="companyName" required minlength="2" /></label>
            <label><span class="lb-t" data-i18n="companyType">Company type</span>
              <select name="companyType" required>
                <option value="carrier" data-i18n="tCarrier">Carrier</option>
                <option value="owner_operator" data-i18n="tOwnerOp">Owner-Operator</option>
                <option value="fleet" data-i18n="tFleet">Fleet</option>
                <option value="dispatcher" data-i18n="tDispatcher">Dispatcher / dispatch company</option>
                <option value="broker" data-i18n="tBroker">Broker</option>
                <option value="shipper" data-i18n="tShipper">Shipper</option>
                <option value="dealer" data-i18n="tDealer">Dealer</option>
                <option value="other" data-i18n="tOther">Other</option>
              </select>
            </label>
            <div class="lb-form-row">
              <label><span class="lb-t" data-i18n="city">City</span><input name="city" required minlength="2" /></label>
              <label><span class="lb-t" data-i18n="state">State</span><input name="state" required maxlength="2" minlength="2" placeholder="IL" /></label>
            </div>
            <label><span class="lb-t" data-i18n="website">Website</span> <span data-i18n="optional">optional</span><input name="website" inputmode="url" placeholder="yourcompany.com" /></label>
            <label><span class="lb-t" data-i18n="phone">Phone for a callback</span> <span data-i18n="phoneNote">optional · not published</span><input name="callbackPhone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" inputmode="tel" placeholder="+1 312 555 0100" /></label>
            <label><span class="lb-t" data-i18n="authority">MC / USDOT</span> <span data-i18n="optionalPrivate">optional · private</span><input name="authorityNumber" autocomplete="off" /></label>
            <label class="lb-check"><input name="catalogOptIn" type="checkbox" checked /><span><strong data-i18n="catalogStrong">Add my company to Hermes Catalog.</strong><span class="lb-ct" data-i18n="catalogText"> Company name, category, city and state can appear immediately as “Self-submitted · verification pending.” Private authority/account data is not published. A dedicated SEO/GEO company page is not created until verification.</span></span></label>
            <button class="lb-primary" type="submit" data-i18n="saveBtn">Save company & continue</button>
          </form>
          <p class="lb-message" data-company-message role="status"></p>
        </div>

        <aside class="lb-access-side">
          <p class="lb-kicker" data-i18n="next">What happens next</p>
          <h2 data-i18n="loopH">This is one connected Hermes loop.</h2>
          <ol>
            <li><strong data-i18n="n1s">Preview.</strong><span class="lb-ct" data-i18n="n1"> You can see the Load Board interface and truthful aggregate inventory before registering.</span></li>
            <li><strong data-i18n="n2s">Register.</strong><span class="lb-ct" data-i18n="n2"> The same Hermes identity is used across Hermes Connect.</span></li>
            <li><strong data-i18n="n3s">Company.</strong><span class="lb-ct" data-i18n="n3"> Your operating company becomes the access owner for the Load Board.</span></li>
            <li><strong data-i18n="n4s">Catalog.</strong><span class="lb-ct" data-i18n="n4"> If you opt in, a safe self-submitted company card can appear in Hermes Catalog while verification is pending.</span></li>
            <li><strong data-i18n="n5s">Operate.</strong><span class="lb-ct" data-i18n="n5"> Dealers and shippers may manage their own requests. Carriers need Hermes approval and an assigned dispatcher before requesting loads.</span></li>
          </ol>
          <a href="/businesses/" data-i18n="seeCatalog">See Hermes Catalog →</a>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

